msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Open the gate! "
msgctxt "bark 0404:0E92"
msgid "Sure I will! In fact, I'll not only just fling them open for ya, I'll scoop ya up in me lovin' arms and carry ya into the city meself! "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Open the gate! "
msgctxt "bark 0404:0EE6"
msgid "No! I'll -not- be openin' this gate! Not under pain of death! "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "Open the gate! "
